# Diagnostic state dumps embed invoice OCR text, which can include bank and
# routing numbers. They live in Application Support; these patterns catch a copy
# exported into the repo by accident. Anchored, because git on macOS matches
# ignore patterns case-insensitively and would otherwise swallow
# Sources/InvoiceOrganizer/Infrastructure/Diagnostics/.
/diagnostics/
state-*.json

